Dear Mr./Ms. {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.EYI_Opportunity_Name__c},
Warm Greetings from Panchshil !

We are pleased to confirm the receipt of your payment for the raised demand against your unit at {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name}. Below is a summary of the payment details:

• Amount Received: {!$Record.EYI_Amount__c}
• Payment Receipt Number: {!$Record.Name}
• Check Number: {!$Record.EYI_Check_number__c}
• Check Bank Name: {!$Record.EYI_Bank_Name__c}
• Check Amount: {!$Record.EYI_Amount__c}
• Date of Payment: {!$Record.EYI_Bank_Payment_Confirmation_Date__c}

Thank you once again for choosing Panchshil  and for your continued cooperation. We look forward to moving ahead with the next steps and keeping you updated on the progress.

Best regards, 
Panchshil Team

